resources.string:
1. A Gemini key — free, one minute:
• open aistudio.google.com in a browser on the phone or a computer;
• sign in with your usual Google account (Gmail);
• in the left menu — “Get API key” (or “Create API key”) → “Create API key in new project”;
• copy the generated string (it starts with AIzaSy…);
• here, in “Gemini API key”, paste it and press “Check key” — you will see “key works”, and “Model” picks itself.
2. Turn on “✦ button in the car browser”.
3. Optionally — the model (2.5 free, 3.8 better but paid), voice, microphone, navigator for routes, conversation style (tone, form of address, name).
